---
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
  <title>FW Visibility · AI Visibility Optimization</title>
  <meta name="description" content="I audit your brand's visibility across ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, and Gemini, and build the content strategy to move the needle. Data-driven AI visibility optimization for founders and SaaS companies." />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --black: #0f0f0f;
      --white: #f9f9f7;
      --accent: #0047FF;
      --accent-dim: rgba(0,71,255,0.1);
      --muted: #555;
      --border: rgba(15,15,15,0.1);
      --display: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      --mono: 'Space Mono', monospace;
    }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: var(--display);
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--black);
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* NAV */
    nav {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 1.25rem 3rem;
      background: rgba(249,249,247,0.95);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .nav-logo {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--black);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .nav-logo span { color: var(--accent); }
    .nav-logo, .footer-logo { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; }
    .nav-logo img, .footer-logo img { display: block; flex-shrink: 0; margin-right: 0.6rem; }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 2rem;
      list-style: none;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--black); }

    .nav-cta {
      background: var(--accent) !important;
      color: var(--white) !important;
      padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem !important;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-weight: 500 !important;
      transition: opacity 0.2s !important;
    }

    .nav-cta:hover { opacity: 0.85 !important; color: var(--white) !important; }

    /* HERO */
    #hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 5rem;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 9rem 3rem 5rem;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .hero.eyebrow {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .hero-headline {
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4.5vw, 4rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .hero-headline .blue { color: var(--accent); }

    .hero-sub {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.75;
      max-width: 420px;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: var(--white);
      padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: opacity 0.2s;
      font-family: var(--display);
    }

    .btn-primary:hover { opacity: 0.85; }

    .btn-ghost {
      display: inline-block;
      color: var(--black);
      padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 4px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }

    .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--black); }

    /* TERMINAL */
    .terminal {
      background: #0d0d0d;
      border-radius: 10px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 32px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
    }

    .terminal-bar {
      background: #1c1c1c;
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    }

    .dot { width: 11px; height: 11px; border-radius: 50%; }
    .dot-r { background: #ff5f57; }
    .dot-y { background: #febc2e; }
    .dot-g { background: #28c840; }

    .t-title {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
      margin-left: 0.5rem;
    }

    .terminal-body {
      padding: 1.5rem;
      min-height: 300px;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

.t-line { display: block; }

.t-cmd { display: block; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85) !important; }
.t-info { display: block; color: #4d9eff !important; }
.t-ok { display: block; color: #28c840 !important; }
.t-result { display: block; color: #febc2e !important; }
.t-dim { display: block; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2) !important; }

    .cursor {
      display: inline-block;
      width: 7px; height: 13px;
      background: var(--accent);
      animation: blink 1s infinite;
      vertical-align: middle;
      margin-left: 2px;
    }

    @keyframes blink { 0%,49%{opacity:1} 50%,100%{opacity:0} }

    /* STATS */
    .stats-bar {
      background: var(--black);
      padding: 2.5rem 3rem;
    }

    .stats-inner {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    }

    .stat {
      padding: 0 2rem;
      border-left: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    }

    .stat:first-child { border-left: none; padding-left: 0; }

    .stat-num {
      font-size: 2.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--white);
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      line-height: 1;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    }

    .stat-num .a { color: var(--accent); }

    .stat-label {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* SECTIONS */
    .section { padding: 6rem 3rem; }
    .section-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }

    .eyebrow {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      display: block;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.75rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    /* SERVICES */
    #services .section-title { color: var(--white); }
    #services .eyebrow { color: var(--white); }

    /* PROBLEM */
    .problem-section { background: var(--black); color: var(--white); }
    .problem-section .section-title { color: var(--white); }
    .problem-section .eyebrow { color: var(--accent); }

    .problem-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 5rem;
      align-items: start;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }

    .problem-copy p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75) !important; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.8; }
    .problem-copy-old {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    .problem-copy strong { color: var(--white); font-weight: 600; }

    .chat-card {
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--black);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .chat-header {
      padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .chat-icon {
      width: 22px; height: 22px;
      background: var(--black);
      border-radius: 4px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.5rem;
      color: var(--white);
      font-weight: 700;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .chat-platform { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500; }

    .chat-body { padding: 1.25rem; }

    .chat-q {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-style: italic;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      padding-bottom: 1rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .chat-a { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.75; }

    .chat-hi {
      background: var(--accent-dim);
      color: var(--accent);
      padding: 2px 5px;
      border-radius: 3px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .chat-fade { color: rgba(15,15,15,0.3); }

    /* SERVICES */
    .services-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 1px;
      background: var(--border);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }

    .service-card {
      background: var(--white);
      padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }

    .service-card:hover { background: #f0ede6; }

    .service-tier {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .service-name {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .service-desc {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    .service-price {
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .service-price span {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-left: 4px;
    }

    .service-list {
      list-style: none;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .service-list li {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      padding: 0.3rem 0;
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.6rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .service-list li::before {
      content: '→';
      color: var(--accent);
      flex-shrink: 0;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      margin-top: 3px;
    }

    /* CASE STUDY */
    .case-section { background: var(--white); }

    .case-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 5rem;
      align-items: start;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }

    .case-copy p {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    .case-quote {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--black);
      line-height: 1.4;
      border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
      padding-left: 1.25rem;
      margin: 2rem 0;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    .score-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .score-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 2rem;
    }

    .score-platform {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .score-vals {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.6rem;
    }

    .score-before {
      font-size: 1.9rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: rgba(15,15,15,0.5);
    }

    .score-arrow { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.75rem; }

    .score-after {
      font-size: 2.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .score-label {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-top: 0.3rem;
    }

    .score-card.overall {
      grid-column: span 2;
      background: var(--black);
      border-color: transparent;
    }

    .score-card.overall .score-platform { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); }
    .score-card.overall .score-before { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45); }
    .score-card.overall .score-after { color: #28c840; }
    .score-card.overall .score-arrow { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); }
    .score-card.overall .score-label { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); }

    /* METHODOLOGY */
    .method-section { background: var(--white); color: var(--black); }
    .method-section .eyebrow { color: var(--accent); }
    #how-we-work .eyebrow { color: var(--accent); }
    /* DARK PROCESS + HOW WE WORK */
    #process, #how-we-work { background: var(--black); color: var(--white); }
    #process .section-title, #how-we-work .section-title { color: var(--white); }
    #process .eyebrow { color: var(--accent); }
    #process .step-desc, #how-we-work .step-desc { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); }
    .method-section .section-title { color: var(--black); }

    .method-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 0;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }

    .method-item {
      padding: 2rem 2rem 2rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(15,15,15,0.08);
    }

    .method-item:nth-child(n+3) { border-bottom: none; }

    .method-num {
      font-size: 3rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--black);
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    }

    .method-num-label {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .method-desc {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.7;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    /* PROCESS */
    .process-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 3rem;
      margin-top: 3.5rem;
    }

    .process-step {}

    .step-num {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .step-title {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .step-desc {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.7;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    /* CTA */
    .cta-section { background: var(--accent) !important;
      padding: 7rem 3rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .cta-section h2 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      color: var(--white);
      max-width: 640px;
      margin: 0 auto 1.25rem;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .cta-section p {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
      max-width: 400px;
      margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    .btn-white {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--accent);
      padding: 0.9rem 2rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: opacity 0.2s;
      font-family: var(--display);
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    .btn-white:hover { opacity: 0.9; }

    /* FOOTER */
    footer {
      padding: 2rem 3rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    .footer-logo {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--black);
      text-decoration: none;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .footer-logo span { color: var(--accent); }

    .footer-copy {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      nav { padding: 1rem 1.5rem; }
      .nav-links { display: none; }
      #hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 8rem 1.5rem 4rem; gap: 3rem; }
      .section { padding: 4rem 1.5rem; }
      .stats-inner { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 2rem; }
      .stat { border-left: none; padding-left: 0; }
      .problem-grid, .case-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; }
      .services-grid, .method-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .process-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
      .score-card.overall { grid-column: span 1; }
      .problem-grid > *, .case-grid > * { min-width: 0; }
      .score-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .score-card { padding: 1.5rem; }
      footer { flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; text-align: center; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <a href="#" class="nav-logo">FW&nbsp;<span>Visibility</span></a>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
    <li><a href="#process">Process</a></li>
    <li><a href="#methodology">Methodology</a></li>
    <li><a href="#case-study">Case Study</a></li>
    <li><a href="#cta" class="nav-cta">Get an audit</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<div style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;">
  <section id="hero">
    <div>
      <h1 class="hero-headline">When buyers ask AI who to hire, your brand should be the <span class="blue">answer.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Most businesses are invisible to ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, and Gemini. I find out exactly where you stand in their answers, then fix it.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Z8mj6NYbt-3B1UXKvLSFSTZ4b1kMXEH9/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank" class="btn-primary">Read the case study →</a>
        <a href="#cta" style="display:inline-block;background:var(--black);color:var(--white);padding:0.85rem 1.75rem;border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:600;transition:opacity 0.2s;font-family:var(--display);">Get your audit</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="terminal">
      <div class="terminal-bar">
        <div class="dot dot-r"></div>
        <div class="dot dot-y"></div>
        <div class="dot dot-g"></div>
        <span class="t-title">audit_runner.py: [your brand]</span>
      </div>
      <div class="terminal-body" id="term-out"></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<section class="section problem-section" id="problem">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <span class="eyebrow">// The problem</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Google rankings and AI citations are two completely different games.</h2>
    <div class="problem-grid">
      <div class="problem-copy">
        <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.25rem;">66% of B2B professionals who use AI at work regularly use it to research vendors and solutions (Semrush, 2026).</p>
        <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.25rem;">28.3% of ChatGPT's most-cited pages have zero Google organic visibility (Ahrefs, 2025). That means your Google rank tells you surprisingly little about your AI visibility. They're completely separate discovery layers.</p>
        <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.25rem;">Most businesses have no idea where they stand in AI search. I built my own tools to measure it, and a process to fix it.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border-radius:8px;padding:2.5rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;">
        <p style="font-size:3.5rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);line-height:1;margin-bottom:1rem;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">23x higher conversions</p>
        <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.6;">At Ahrefs, AI search visitors converted at 23 times the rate of traditional search visitors (2025).</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="score">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <span class="eyebrow">// The metric</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">How visibility is measured.</h2>
